#. なんなんだ…？　なんなんだあの映像！？
#. そんなんじゃ分かんねーべ！
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What is it? What are we looking at!? *That's* what we\n"
"need to figure out!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 黙っていろ…今は俺の思考の邪魔をするな！
#. あの映像の謎が分かるまでな！
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Shut up! Leave me alone until I figure out what the\n"
"hell it is I'm looking at!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何も…何も…何も覚えてないのよ！
#. そんなもの見せられたって…！
msgctxt "0005 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Nothing...n-nothing... Show me whatever you want, I\n"
"d-don't remember anything!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかにこの議論の矛盾が隠されているはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there somewhere...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>思い出せなきゃ…終わる…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I can't remember...is it all over?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、あんな訳のわからない映像見せられて、
#. その意味を思い出せとか言われても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, how can she show me something so completely\n"
"incomprehensible and then just say remember!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも<CLT><CLT 3>“全員”<CLT><CLT 4>が記憶を失っている状況じゃ…<CLT>
#. <CLT 4>どうしようも…<CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean,<CLT><CLT 3> <CLT><CLT 4><CLT><CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>everyone one of us<CLT> <CLT 4>has lost our memory...!<CLT>\n"
"<CLT 4>It really is hopeless, after all...<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>思い出せなきゃ…終わる…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I can't remember...is it all over?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、あんな訳のわからない映像見せられて、
#. その意味を思い出せとか言われても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I mean, how can she show me something so completely\n"
"incomprehensible and then just say remember!?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そもそも<CLT><CLT 3>“全員”<CLT><CLT 4>が記憶を失っている状況じゃ…
#. どうしようも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>Every single one of us<CLT><CLT 4> has lost our memory...!\n"
"It really is hopeless, after all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、ひょっとして<CLT><CLT 3>彼女<CLT><CLT 4>なら…
#. 忘れていないかもしれない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, wait...there's a chance that <CLT><CLT 3>she<CLT><CLT 4> hasn't\n"
"forgotten...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
